@title Docked windows stack from the top: windows open in the right strip, fold and unfold in place, order stays (schematic, 1366x768)
@area Windows
@sizes 1366x768
open_starter_example
wait 30
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text preferences
wait 6
key Enter
wait 40
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text standards check
wait 6
key Enter
wait 40
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text project settings
wait 6
key Enter
wait 40
shot windows-open
check_layout
# Fold the first window: it keeps its title row at the top and the others move up under it.
click 1061 72
wait 30
shot first-folded
check_layout
# Fold the second as well: both title rows stay at the top, in order.
click 1061 101
wait 30
shot two-folded
check_layout
# Unfold the first: it grows downward, the folded one stays right under it.
click 1061 72
wait 30
shot first-unfolded
check_layout
